# Invest Bot — Python Conventions

## Scope & style
- **Minimal diffs** — match existing naming, logging, ThreadPoolExecutor patterns
- Config lives at top of `global_screener.py`; avoid scattering magic numbers
- Do not add tests/docs unless asked

## API & I/O
- FMP via `fmp_get()` with 429 backoff; redact API keys in logs
- yfinance for backtest + volume fallback when FMP fails
- Partial rerun: `fetch_llm_context_light()` — **no FMP** by default
- NaN-safe: `volume_attention_score` use `pd.isna()` before `float()` (see `refresh_volume_attention.py`)

## Scoring changes
- Volume attention: `fetch_volume_attention` → `apply_volume_attention_bonus` → then valuation ±5
- Pearl vs 轉折 mutually ordered: low Z first, then surge/breakout
- Updating CSV scores: subtract old `volume_attention_score` before adding new bonus (idempotent)

## LLM
- Judge: JSON mode via `_call_judge_llm()` / `_parse_llm_json()` — no tool calling on Judge
- Store full debate in `debate_json` for audit/backtest loops
- `llm_parse_ok=False` rows need `partial_rerun.py`, not full rescan

## Backtest helpers
- Use `_extract_close_series` + `_hist_total_return_pct` (handles MultiIndex + NaN Close)
- `run_backtest`: US only, max 20 tickers/tier
- `run_backtest_attention_groups`: tier × `潛在珍珠|共識轉折|neutral`

## GUI / PyInstaller
- Entry: `invest_bot_gui.py`; spec `invest_bot.spec` — `console=False`, icon `assets/invest_bot.ico`
- Long tasks in **background thread**; redirect stdout to queue (do not block tkinter main loop)
- Rebuild: `.\build_exe.ps1` (generates icon + onefile exe)

## Do not
- Commit `.env`, `*.db`, large CSV backups without user request
- Force-push or amend commits unless user explicitly asks
- Claim backtest proves alpha without median + methodology caveats
